<title>USA: Granite Q1 Sept 30 full results.</title>
<headline>Granite Q1 Sept 30 full results.</headline>
<dateline>WESTMINSTER, Colo. 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>3 Months Ended 3 Months Ended</p>
<p>						Sep 30,	     Sep 30,</p>
<p>						  1996		  1995</p>
<p>Revenues</p>
<p> Sales of leases		    $10,426,221	  $4,632,293</p>
<p>Income from direct financing leases</p>
<p>						929,614		16,684</p>
<p> Total revenues			11,355,835	   4,648,977</p>
<p>Costs</p>
